00:15:04.671 --> 00:15:05.790
Share this with your principal.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:09.180
Share it with your soccer mom, other kids
that you're dealing with and see what they

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.459
say about it.

00:15:10.459 --> 00:15:13.779
See if you're the only one that reads this
and says, that some of this stuff makes sense.

00:15:13.779 --> 00:15:18.550
And again, I think it's an important topic
for us to start talking about because I think

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:26.070
the more people become entrepreneurs and find
ways to make money on their own, the economy

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:31.399
will do better, jobs will do better, everyone
will do better and they'll create jobs for

00:15:31.399 --> 00:15:37.610
